      "note": "PROVISIONAL machine alignment proposed independently by Codex, Tibetan-first. GMR English is preserved verbatim; no dictionary promotion. Technical compounds and their defensible members remain whole, including the published comma in Phenomena, mastery. Commentary 322 clarifies this name but supplies no replacement English. The second uninterrupted path is an elliptical whole-compound rendering; no false path null or degenerate member is created. Causatives and repeated colors have separately checked occurrences."
